# Copy and icon conventions

## No em dash

Do not use the Unicode em dash `—` (U+2014) anywhere: UI copy, i18n, docs, comments, commit messages, or rules.

Prefer one of these instead:

- Hyphen / en range: `Gross-Net`, `2025-2026`
- Colon or period for a break: `Ước tính offline. Không thay tư vấn.`
- Rewrite the sentence so a dash is unnecessary
- Middle dot already used in brand copy: `lương · thuế · bảo hiểm` (keep if intentional)

```text
Bad:  So offer Gross–Net — ngay trên máy bạn.
Good: So offer Gross-Net ngay trên máy bạn.
Good: So offer Gross-Net. Kết quả hiện ngay trên máy bạn.
```

## No emoji

Do not use emoji characters in UI, copy, docs, or code.

When a visual mark is needed:

1. Add or extend an SVG path in `scripts/generate-ui-icons.mjs`
2. Run `node scripts/generate-ui-icons.mjs` to write `assets/icons/<name>.png`
3. Register the asset in `src/components/common/AppIcon.tsx` and render `<AppIcon name="..." />`

Do not use emoji as icons, list bullets, status badges, or empty-state decoration.
